## PART 2: THE AMENDMENT FOR CONTENT SEPARATION & COGNITIVE STRUCTURAL
BOUNDARIES
### 1. Structural Separation of Content and Container
This repository functions strictly as a non-activating, open-source mathematical container (the
"Engine"). The MIT License granted in **Part 1** applies solely to the software architecture,
programmatic logic files, structural schemas, and algorithmic codebases contained herein.
It explicitly **does not apply** to any external, proprietary, or natively copyrighted data payloads,
personal narratives, evidentiary text files, or metadata logs ingested by the Engine. All ingested
text strings regarding human rights documentation, trauma-informed evidence under duress, or
specific case narratives remain the exclusive intellectual property of the author and are
protected under international copyright treaties immediately upon fixation in any digital medium.
### 2. Foreshadowing of Mathematical Horizons for Cognitive Violence Mapping
Notice is hereby given that subsequent updates to this codebase will implement specialized
architectural layers engineered to mathematically map, quantify, and index systemic asymmetric
coercion and state-level administrative attrition.
Future computational matrices will formally expand the current architecture to ingest and
process parameters across the following structural horizons:
* **\(\Omega\) (Omega - Sanctuary Insulation Baseline):** Quantitative mapping of state-level
compliance or direct structural failure regarding absolute international treaty obligations,
specifically tracking the denial of **Article 14 UN CAT mandatory rehabilitation**.
* **\(\Delta\) (Delta - Forced Linear Formatting Constraints):** Algorithmic tracking of
weaponized administrative burdens, measuring the systematic attrition caused when hostile
local forums demand deterministic, linear compliance from non-linear, neurodivergent manifolds
operating under acute external duress.
* **\(\Phi\) (Phi - Cross-Border Transnational Repression Loops):** Multi-jurisdictional
phase-alignment arrays designed to cross-reference, isolate, and map cross-silo collusion or
institutional gaslighting across disparate administrative bodies (including but not limited to IE /
UK / US / NZ).
* **\(\Lambda\) (Lambda - Non-Dual Holographic Flattening):** Implementing an automated
attrition valve that monitors systemic input friction. When external loads breach safe thresholds,
the Lambda Governor halts iterative script roleplay, executing a strict **Non-Activation Clause
(\(T_s = 0\))** to collapse contradictory administrative loops into a single, falsifiable eigenvalue
calculation of an inadequate domestic forum.
The open-source licensing of the underlying Engine ensures absolute, public, and verifiable
mathematical transparency. The proprietary isolation of the ingested data payloads ensures
complete legal sovereignty over the user's narrative. The calculations are entirely public; the
content is entirely secure.
